      *
      * A complete RPG/400 cycle program: every specification type in the
      * order the compiler requires, embedded SQL, and a compile-time
      * alternating table with the records that load it.
      *
      * Prints an invoice register grouped by store, taking the tax rate
      * from a compile-time table and the customer name from SQL.
      *
      * Member: INVREG   Compilable: complete program, but not built;
      *         its files are not defined here (CRTSQLRPG)
      * Source: RPG/400 Reference SC09-1817, and IBM i 7.5 Embedded SQL
      *         programming for the EXEC SQL layout.
      * Retrieved: 2026-07-26
      *
      *
      * Control specification.
     H        1   M D                                                     INVREG
     F*
     F* The invoice header drives the cycle as the primary file. The
     F* printer file has an overflow indicator and an L in position 39,
     F* which says a line counter specification follows.
     FINVHDR  IP  E           K        DISK                               input
     FQSYSPRT O   F     132     OV    LPRINTER                            report
     E*
     E* An alternating compile-time table: a tax code and the rate that
     E* goes with it, loaded from the records at the end of the source.
     E                    TAXCDE  1   5  3  ATAXRAT  5 4 Tax codes and rates
     L*
     L* 66 lines to a page, overflow on line 60.
     LQSYSPRT  66FL 60OL
     I*
     I* The record format of the externally described file, with five
     I* fields renamed and a control level break on the store number.
     IINVREC      01                                                      detail
     I              INVSTORE                        STORE L1
     I              INVNUMBER                       INVNO
     I              INVCUSTNBR                      CUSNO
     I              INVAMOUNT                       INVAMT
     I              INVTAXCODE                      TAXCD
     I*
     I* The program status data structure.
     IPSDS       SDS                                                      status
     I                                        1  10 PSPGM
     I                                      254 263 PSSTAT
     I*
     I* Named constants used by the report.
     I              'INVOICE REGISTER'    C         HDRTXT
     I              'STORE TOTAL'         C         STRTXT
     C*
     C* Detail calculations, run once for each invoice record.
     C   01                EXSR GETCUS                     customer name
     C   01      TAXCD     LOKUPTAXCDE                   30
     C   30      INVAMT    MULT TAXRAT    TAX     92H
     C  N30                Z-ADD*ZERO     TAX
     C   01      INVAMT    ADD  TAX       LINTOT  92
     C   01      LINTOT    ADD  STRTOT    STRTOT 112
     C*
     C* Total calculations. STRTOT rolls into GRDTOT at each store
     C* break, then resets ready for the next store.
     CL1         STRTOT    ADD  GRDTOT    GRDTOT 132
     CL1                   Z-ADD*ZERO     STRTOT           reset for next store
     C*
     C* Subroutines. The SQL statement reads the customer name for the
     C* invoice being printed; SQLCOD is a field of the SQLCA, which
     C* the precompiler inserts into the input specifications.
     CSR         GETCUS    BEGSR
     C/EXEC SQL SELECT CUSNAM
     C+ INTO :CUSTNM
     C+ FROM CUSTMAST
     C+ WHERE CUSNBR = :CUSNO
     C/END-EXEC
     C           SQLCOD    COMP 0                        40
     C  N40      '*UNKNOWN'MOVE           CUSTNM
     CSR                   ENDSR
     CSR         *INZSR    BEGSR
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     STRTOT
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     GRDTOT
     C           *BLANKS   MOVE           CUSTNM 30
     CSR                   ENDSR
     O*
     O* Headings print on the first page and after each overflow.
     OQSYSPRT H  201   1P
     O                         HDRTXT    40
     O                         UDATE Y   60
     O                                   70 'PAGE'
     O                         PAGE  Z   76
     OQSYSPRT H  2     OV
     O                         HDRTXT    40
     O*
     O* One line for each invoice.
     OQSYSPRT D  1     01
     O                         STORE      5
     O                         INVNO     16
     O                         CUSTNM    48
     O                         INVAMT1   62
     O                         TAX   1   76
     O                         LINTOT1   92
     O*
     O* A total at each store break, and a grand total at the end.
     OQSYSPRT T 12     L1
     O                         STRTXT    40
     O                         STRTOTJB  92
     OQSYSPRT T 2      LR
     O                                   40 'GRAND TOTAL'
     O                         GRDTOTJ   92
      *
      * The alternating table, one pair to a record: a three character
      * tax code followed by a five digit rate with four decimals.
**    TAXCDE and TAXRAT
A1000625
B2000750
C3000825
D4000900
E5001000
